§ `Run default fixture`

-- W11: a plain #EVAL says which TYPICALLY default it took, in the Notes of
-- `l4 run` and in the "notes" of its JSON, and says nothing when the value
-- was supplied.

    GIVEN `the rate` IS A NUMBER TYPICALLY 3

GIVETH A NUMBER
doubled MEANS `the rate` TIMES 2

#EVAL doubled
#EVAL doubled WITH `the rate` IS 5
